  "description": "Shirota Laundry is a refined, high-key WordPress theme crafted for commercial laundries, linen rental services, and textile care facilities. Built with an editorial serif aesthetic, hairline weave grids, and signature oval viewports inspired by commercial pressing lines, it presents service indices, route schedules, and transparent rate tables with quiet clarity. Designed for full site editing, the theme offers responsive layouts, subtle motion, and structured multi-language support.",
